   191   *      accounting headers.  The packet may still be determined later
   192   *      to be invalid.
   193   *
   194   * @param buffer        to check
   195   * @param buffer_len    length of the buffer
   196   * @return
   197   *      >0              size of the TACACS+ packet.  We want.  MAY be larger than "buffer_len"
   198   *      <=0             error, packet should be discarded.
   199   */
   200  ssize_t fr_tacacs_length(uint8_t const *buffer, size_t buffer_len)
   201  {
